WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:06.280
Please, tell me how to cure ZONAPHA.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.750
You took Éléonore away from me.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.790
And you come to me now?

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.880
No way, you moron.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.840
You could at least try to torture me
into saying it.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.760
Fine.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.430
You asked for it.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.970
Ooh, you're scaring me.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.430
You can't kill me, though,
or the secret will be lost.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.390
Arlequin!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.400
Arlequin?

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.700
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.870
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:06.420
All I want is to be with those I love

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:12.550
Ready or not
Here I come

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:16.220
I don't care anymore

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:19.020
I just don't know anymore

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.560
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.690
There are days when I think like that

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:28.610
But everything is precious to me

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.450
And so I fight on

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.950
Today was a tough day

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:38.040
I almost gave up hope

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:44.130
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.750
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.010
There are days when I think like that

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.800
But everything is precious to me

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:56.800
And so I must fight

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.320
#36 The curtain falls

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:17.530
Surprised? It's stronger
than the one my brother Yin made.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.750
-Grim Reaper!
-Blade of Saint George!

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.710
This is getting interesting.

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:31.210
Oh yes, I wanted to ask you something.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.970
Why did you give Éléonore up to Narumi?

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.300
Go, Kato.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.180
I'll go up to space.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:45.980
You thought of her first
as a mother, nay, a sister.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:53.650
But once you hit puberty, you began
to see Éléonore as a beautiful female.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.490
Shut up! Shirogane isn't like that!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.870
That's not what she is to me.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:06.620
Maybe not to a normal boy,
but I was partially downloaded into you.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:10.880
Your brain knows
how men and women fall in love.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.510
Master is no match for him.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:19.140
And so you realized what you felt
in your heart.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.760
At Mont Saint-Michel.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:28.480
"Oh, how I love Shirogane," you thought.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.400
Admit it, Masaru. Swirling Tiger!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.280
You bound the legs, nice move.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:46.160
Are you okay, Master?
You're getting all beaten up.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:51.170
Will you tell me the truth now?

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:57.930
You love Éléonore, don't you?

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:01.760
Love...

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.430
What is love?

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:14.730
But maybe you're right.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.530
You finally realized it?

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.610
Then why did you let Narumi have her?

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.740
Éléonore ages 5 times slower than you.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:31.630
You would've caught up to her.
You could've been her boyfriend.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:35.880
What?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.510
Because...

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.760
-Because...!
-Give it up.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.100
Futile!

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.020
Say it! Why did you give the girl up?

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:51.810
Because!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:57.780
Narumi was the one
that fell in love with her first!

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.950
I fell in love with Francine first.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.870
You can't take her from me.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.540
You can't.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:12.370
Brother.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:25.140
This is Fou. Any contact from Masaru yet?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:29.730
Oh, shut up.
I'll go ask Lord Faceless for you.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:37.400
He fell in love with her first?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:41.400
You should've ignored him
and taken her for yourself.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.030
But then...

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.910
would I have been happy?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:56.250
Besides, Shirogane loves Narumi too.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.880
Isn't that what matters most?

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.550
That's enough about me.

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:08.810
So come on, tell me how to cure ZONAPHA.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.560
Wrong!

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.440
Nothing is more important than yourself.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:20.190
You make the girl you want
fall in love with you.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.700
Then...

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:28.990
you'll never be loved by anyone.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:35.500
If you can only embrace yourself...

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.460
who would ever embrace you?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.300
Forget it, I'm done with you.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:46.550
I got my answer, now die.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.230
Why...?

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.320
Lord Faceless!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.330
You don't need these girls anymore.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:14.580
Ta-da! I'm here to be by your side now.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.370
Why are you here?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.920
None of your business.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.340
What is it?

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.920
I came because
I wanted to ask you something.

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:30.180
Lord Faceless, do you love me?

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:36.940
Because can you believe
what Colombine said to me?

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.320
Lord Faceless loves you.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:45.360
But only as a useful tool.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:49.110
I won't have that. I'm no tool.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:54.160
Lord Faceless,
tell me that I'm your girlfriend.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:57.580
Say that you love me.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.340
Yeah, I love you Diamantina.

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:06.840
Yay! I knew it.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:11.350
But here's what I really want you to say.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.100
That you love me more than Éléonore.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:20.980
No, more than the girl
Éléonore was modeled after.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.610
Say you love me more than Francine.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.030
Master, now's our chance to run!

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.240
No, I have to ask how to stop ZONAPHA.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.990
Don't bother us. Can't you see we're busy?

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.660
They'll all explode at my signal.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:43.880
Don't move. There's more
strolling around this space station.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.380
Lord Faceless.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:53.930
Say you'll love me forever.
Me and only me.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:09:00.600
Why can't it be me?
Please, love me.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.820
You take after your creator.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.400
But...

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:13.070
I have the freedom
to love whomever I want.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.490
Dismantle!

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.250
That's what you've been
trying to say, right?

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.920
Lord Faceless!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.050
How cruel...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:35.930
I love you so much...

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:41.390
But... you won't love me back...

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.940
Too bad, huh.

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.320
Alert.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:55.450
Due to multiple explosions,
Space Station Alpha cannot maintain orbit.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:10:01.540
This station will crash-land within
40 km of Russia's Bodny Cosmodrome.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.540
Bodny? No...

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:10.260
Splendid. We'll take Éléonore down with us
as our final curtain falls.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.300
Tell me how to cure ZONAPHA!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.300
-Never, you fool.
-Then at least!

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:20.560
How do I make this space station
fall where there's no one?

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.690
Another request?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:28.020
Tell me this. Tell me that.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.150
I'm your enemy, remember?

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:33.150
Don't you have any pride
in that empty skull?

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.700
You're so stupid and worthless.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.660
I'm tired of talking to you.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.710
Alpha, you answer him.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.790
I will answer you.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.300
The attitude control actuator
is inoperable due to the explosions.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:55.050
The point of impact cannot be altered.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:56.930
Is that it?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.260
That thing has to face more upward.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:02.640
I'll go out there in a space suit.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.940
It is too late.
The suit takes 3 hours to put on.

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:07.560
Dammit.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.820
You sure are stupid.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.240
I don't care, I have to save them.

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:16.860
Even if you'll be dead in 45 minutes?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.370
Yes, even if.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:25.620
I can't watch this.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.880
8 minutes until ignition.
After 8 minutes, it will be too late.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:36.930
I know. Okay, let's do it.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:42.060
But why are you helping me?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.560
You think I'm up to something?

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.310
I'm not. I just feel like it.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.730
You do the legs. Go slowly now.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.370
Watch it.
Jack's toes are really complex to control.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.920
Sorry, I'll be careful.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.210
-What?
-Nothing.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:20.590
I was just thinking this must be
what it's like to be a big brother.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:26.850
Little brothers can't do anything alone.
Always relying on their brothers.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.100
That's what you feel like.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.850
Yeah, so?

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.820
Yeah, that's how little brothers
talk back.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:39.110
But him...

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.620
he always waited for his little brother.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.370
Okay, push it up.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:52.250
Hmm, I remember doing something like this.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:54.750
With him.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.300
Yes, that's it.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.560
Yeah, I remember now.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.850
I'm just like you.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.020
You're just wasting your life.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.200
I won't tell you how to cure ZONAPHA.

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:24.030
That means your death is meaningless.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.000
You won't even get
the woman that you wanted.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.420
In the end, you're the same as me.

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:35.210
You're wrong.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.180
I have a memory of
the smiles of the person I love.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.390
Smiles are really fragile.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.850
They break so easily
at the littlest things.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.850
But I believe.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:58.940
That I was able to protect her smile
because of my sacrifice.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:04.490
So you and I are different.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.950
I'm not going empty-handed.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.750
Sacrifice, huh?

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.710
That's just being complacent.
A sweet illusion.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.750
I crushed her smile.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.260
Okay Alpha, ignite.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:37.560
Jack...

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:42.110
Time of descent reduced.
6 minutes until atmospheric entry.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.780
Target, the Sea of Okhotsk.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.780
Whew, we made it in time.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.080
That's where Diamantina stabbed you.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.620
Why did you help me?

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:00.880
I told you. I was bored.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.760
Please, tell me how to cure ZONAPHA.

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:07.390
You can save the entire world.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.390
Do something good and go to heaven!

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:17.310
If I went to heaven, I'd meet her again.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:24.490
I guess I could carry her off
one more time.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.490
Come on, Faceless!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:35.580
The Francine dolls and Diamantina
are gone now, too.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.580
Yeah, there's nobody left here
to watch you.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.800
Your bad deeds don't
entertain anybody anymore.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:48.720
No, there's one more left. You.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:54.310
I better put on a good show for you.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.020
The finale is near.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.020
Approaching the atmosphere.

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.360
No...

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.030
Mr. Masaru had gone up in space...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.650
I never imagined he was
that chimney sweep...

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.450
Mr. Fou, Mr. Fou!

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:12.280
Mr. Fou, can you hear me?

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.660
-Masaru!
-Mr. Masaru!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.460
Shirogane, sing!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.170
Sing?

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:31.680
My darling child

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:36.680
My beloved child

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:42.110
Just like the leaves

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:46.230
That dance in the wind

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.700
Your little bed...

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:52.200
Her singing changes
the ZONAPHA bugs' operative mode

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:55.990
from making people sick
to curing people's sicknesses.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:58.960
We've entered the atmosphere.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.420
I'm sorry. You would've lived
if you'd stayed behind.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.880
It's nothing.
I'm your companion, after all.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:10.300
Besides, there'd be no place
for us automata on Earth anyways.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:13.140
I don't want to become
a freak show, either.

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:16.140
Same for me.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:21.060
There never was a place for me
on Earth to begin with.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.940
I'm bored with you all now.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.400
Go out the back door.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.780
There's an emergency return shuttle.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:34.780
Yay, we can go home!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.740
We can go home? Really?

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.160
Then you're coming with me.

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:42.790
We have to live on.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:46.040
We have to keep the circus going.

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:51.010
Join me in the Nakamachi Circus.
We could do a puppet show.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.630
People will love it.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.100
I'm sick of seeing your face.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.390
You go on ahead.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.490
Why did you stay behind?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.740
You're the one that made me.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.450
I guess I'll stick with you.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.710
Come on, hurry. We have to go.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.540
Sorry Master, I'm staying with Faceless.

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.970
No, you're my precious friend!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.470
I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:39.720
You'll make the gears in my eyes
all rusty, Masaru.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:46.940
You just seemed so alone, I couldn't...

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.320
Yeah, I hate being alone.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.200
It's so lonely.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:01.200
Why did you let Master go?

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:07.380
We could do a puppet show, you and me.
People will love it.

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.130
So stupid.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:20.510
He was nothing but a tiny gear
in my grand master plan.

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:23.390
And he wrecked it all up.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:29.690
But you know what?

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:38.740
It's a big brother's job to look out
for his little brother after all.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.500
Yin, my brother...

00:19:55.670 --> 00:20:00.260
I was wrong.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.290
6 YEARS LATER

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.510
You're going to Egmun?

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:40.720
You've got to be kidding,
that's no place for a circus.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:43.300
It's a battlefield out there.

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:46.060
Thank you for your warning.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.940
But there are kids out there
waiting for us.

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:54.570
-How's your arm?
-Perfect.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:59.400
Who'd have thought Masaru and Ashihana
had sent my arm to be preserved

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:02.120
by a cryonics company in the US?

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:06.200
Yes, Mr. Masaru was so full of surprises.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.080
Thanks to him,
I can do this with my real arm.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.460
Oh, you.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.580
Let's get this show on the road.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:19.340
Roll up, roll up! The circus is in town!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.220
-There they are!
-That way!

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:25.720
Somebody, help!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.390
Here you go, little girl.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.230
-Stop!
-Help!

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.480
We've got you now.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.400
Dammit!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:42.910
Thanks...

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.410
You're really strong.

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.120
Are you okay?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:52.040
I want to be strong like you.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:55.500
Do you think I can?

00:21:57.550 --> 00:22:02.010
Sure. Even stronger than me.
